{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS经本机scp疑似绕过隐私控制。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Potential Privacy Control Bypass via Localhost Secure Copy。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS经本机scp疑似绕过隐私控制","references":["https://www.trendmicro.com/en_us/research/20/h/xcsset-mac-malware--infects-xcode-projects--uses-0-days.html"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"c02c8b9f-5e1d-463c-a1b0-04edcdfe1a3d","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type in (\"start\", \"process_started\") and\n process.name == \"scp\" and\n process.args like~ \"StrictHostKeyChecking=no\" and\n process.command_line like~ (\"*scp *localhost:/*\", \"*scp *127.0.0.?:/*\") and\n not process.command_line like~ \"*vagrant@*127.0.0.1*\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS经本机scp疑似绕过隐私控制\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1005","name":"Data from Local System","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1005/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0009","name":"Collection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0009/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":115,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
